update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Thaa Atoll, Central Maldives"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Inhabited Local Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 1,600 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"1.4 km long, 0.9 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"203 km"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Seaplane or domestic flight + speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Remarkable culture, stunning beaches, excellent snorkeling"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Culture enthusiasts, beach lovers, snorkelers, authenticity seekers"}],"island_overview":["Vandhoo Island is a remarkable local island in Thaa Atoll that offers visitors an authentic glimpse into traditional Maldivian life. This outstanding island combines natural beauty with a genuine atmosphere, providing an ideal destination for travelers seeking unique cultural experiences and stunning tropical surroundings.","Known for its beautiful beaches, remarkable coral reefs, and excellent marine biodiversity, Vandhoo provides wonderful opportunities for snorkeling, swimming, and underwater exploration. The island''s authentic community embraces visitors with traditional Maldivian warmth and shares their outstanding way of life with remarkable hospitality.","What makes Vandhoo special is its remarkable natural environment and authentic island setting. Visitors can enjoy stunning beaches, explore rich marine ecosystems, and experience genuine island culture while staying in comfortable accommodations that showcase the remarkable Maldivian lifestyle."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Vandhoo Island is beautifully located in the central part of Thaa Atoll, approximately 203 kilometers from Male. This location provides a remarkable and authentic experience while maintaining good accessibility to the capital and international airport through various transfer options.","The island''s position offers excellent protection from strong currents while providing access to stunning coral reefs and diverse marine ecosystems. Its location in the atoll makes it an ideal base for exploring the natural beauty and cultural richness of Thaa Atoll in its most remarkable form."]},{"heading":"Vandhoo: Remarkable Paradise & Marine Authenticity","paragraphs":["Vandhoo Island is blessed with exceptional natural beauty, featuring stunning white sand beaches, crystal-clear turquoise waters, and one of the most remarkable marine environments in Thaa Atoll. The island offers perfect conditions for beach relaxation and marine exploration in an authentic, genuine setting."]},{"heading":"Stunning White Sand Beaches","paragraphs":["Vandhoo features remarkable white sand beaches with gentle slopes and calm waters, perfect for swimming, sunbathing, and authentic beach activities."]},{"heading":"Remarkable House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["The island''s house reef is easily accessible from the beach and offers outstanding snorkeling with diverse marine life and colorful coral formations."]},{"heading":"Authentic Island Community","paragraphs":["Experience the genuine spirit of traditional island life with friendly locals and remarkable Maldivian culture in an authentic community setting."]},{"heading":"Outstanding Sandbank Adventures","paragraphs":["Explore nearby uninhabited sandbanks and remarkable islands around Vandhoo for stunning tropical paradise experiences with rich marine life."]},{"heading":"Beach Features","paragraphs":["Vandhoo''s coastal highlights include:"]},{"heading":"Marine Environment","paragraphs":["The waters around Vandhoo feature:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Vandhoo offers a perfect blend of marine adventures, cultural experiences, and remarkable activities. The island''s authentic environment and genuine atmosphere provide ideal conditions for various activities in a stunning, unique setting."]},{"heading":"Remarkable House Reef Snorkeling","paragraphs":["Explore the authentic house reef directly from the beach, featuring colorful corals, tropical fish, and excellent underwater visibility in remarkable waters."]},{"heading":"Scuba Diving Excursions","paragraphs":["Discover nearby stunning dive sites with professional dive operators offering guided dives and certification courses in remarkable marine environments."]},{"heading":"Island Hopping Adventures","paragraphs":["Visit nearby islands, stunning sandbanks, and discover the natural beauty of Thaa Atoll with authentic exploration opportunities."]},{"heading":"Traditional Fishing","paragraphs":["Experience authentic Maldivian fishing techniques with local fishermen during sunset and night fishing trips in remarkable community settings."]},{"heading":"Authentic Cultural Immersion","paragraphs":["Learn about local traditions, participate in community activities, and experience remarkable Maldivian island life with genuine cultural exchanges."]},{"heading":"Sunset Cruises","paragraphs":["Enjoy stunning sunset cruises around the atoll, often combined with dolphin watching and traditional dhoni sailing in remarkable waters."]},{"heading":"Community Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Vandhoo is home to approximately 1,600 residents who maintain traditional Maldivian ways of life while embracing sustainable tourism. The island''s community is known for their exceptional friendliness, hospitality, and remarkable cultural traditions that create an authentic atmosphere for visitors."]},{"heading":"Island Life","paragraphs":["Daily life on Vandhoo follows traditional patterns centered around fishing, family, and community activities. The island maintains a remarkable atmosphere where visitors can experience authentic Maldivian culture and customs in their most genuine, outstanding setting."]},{"heading":"Local Traditions","paragraphs":["The community preserves traditional Maldivian practices including traditional music, dance, handicrafts, and fishing techniques. Visitors can observe and often participate in cultural activities and celebrations in this remarkable island environment."]},{"heading":"Sustainable Tourism","paragraphs":["Vandhoo has embraced sustainable tourism practices that benefit the local community while preserving the island''s natural environment and remarkable cultural heritage for future generations to experience and enjoy."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Vandhoo Island?","answer":"Regular ferry services are also available from Male and nearby islands in Thaa Atoll."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Vandhoo?","answer":"The best time to visit Vandhoo is during the dry season from December to April when weather conditions are most favorable for beach activities and water sports. However, the island can be visited year-round with the wet season offering fewer crowds and a more remarkable local atmosphere."},{"question":"What accommodation options are available on Vandhoo?","answer":"Vandhoo offers various accommodations including remarkable guesthouses and beachfront properties. Most accommodations offer air conditioning, private bathrooms, and meal packages in an authentic setting."},{"question":"What makes Vandhoo''s authenticity special?","answer":"Vandhoo is known for its remarkable and authentic natural environment. The island maintains traditional Maldivian cultural practices while offering a genuine atmosphere perfect for unique exploration. Visitors can experience outstanding cultural exchanges and participate in remarkable community activities."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["guraidhoo","gaadhiffushi","dhiyamigili","burunee","vilufushi","veymandoo","thimarafushi","omadhoo","madifushi","kinbidhoo","kandoodhoo","hirilandhoo"]}'::jsonb
