-- vilingili
update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[],"island_overview":[],"island_sections":[],"island_faqs":[{"question":"How do I get to Dhaandhoo Island?","answer":"Public ferry service operates weekly from Male (approximately 17 hours journey time). Private speedboat transfers can be arranged through guesthouses (approximately 5.5 hours from Male)."},{"question":"What is the best time to visit Dhaandhoo Island?","answer":"The best time to visit Dhaandhoo Island is during the northeast monsoon season (December to April), which brings dry, sunny weather with lower humidity and calmer seas. For whale shark encounters, visit during the southwest monsoon (May to December). Water temperature remains warm (27-30C/80-86F) throughout the year."},{"question":"What makes Dhaandhoo different from other local islands in the Maldives?","answer":"Dhaandhoo stands out for its exceptional preservation of traditional Maldivian life in a remote setting. Unlike more developed islands, Dhaandhoo maintains its authentic character with a community still primarily engaged in traditional fishing. The island offers access to Gaafu Alifu Atoll''s spectacular marine life while providing a genuine cultural experience away from mass tourism."},{"question":"Are there any dress code requirements on Dhaandhoo Island?","answer":"As Dhaandhoo is a local inhabited island with a Muslim population, visitors are expected to dress modestly in public areas (shoulders and knees covered). Swimwear is only permitted at the designated \"bikini beach.\" When visiting the mosque or religious sites, women should cover their heads. These requirements don''t apply during water activities or at resort day visits."},{"question":"What marine life can I expect to see while snorkeling around Dhaandhoo?","answer":"Dhaandhoo''s waters offer excellent marine biodiversity, including healthy coral formations with both hard and soft corals. Common sightings include reef sharks (particularly blacktip and whitetip), sea turtles, various ray species, and abundant reef fish. Seasonal visitors include whale sharks (May-December). The house reef provides easy access to this underwater world directly from shore."}],"island_nearby_slugs":[]}'::jsonb
where node_type = 'location' and slug = 'vilingili';


-- villingili
update nodes set attributes = coalesce(attributes, '{}'::jsonb) || '{"island_content_source":"legacy_mtg_guide","island_quick_facts":[{"label":"Location","value":"Kaafu Atoll, adjacent to Male City"},{"label":"Island Type","value":"Residential Island"},{"label":"Population","value":"Approximately 12,000 residents"},{"label":"Size","value":"1.5 km long, 0.8 km wide"},{"label":"Distance from Male","value":"2 km (connected by bridge)"},{"label":"Transfer Options","value":"Bridge connection, ferry, speedboat"},{"label":"Known For","value":"Residential community, suburban living, family environment"},{"label":"Best For","value":"Family stays, peaceful retreats, suburban experiences"}],"island_overview":["Located just adjacent to Male City in Kaafu Atoll, Vilimale Island stands as the perfect example of modern Maldivian suburban living. This peaceful residential island offers visitors a unique glimpse into contemporary island life, where families enjoy the tranquility of suburban paradise while maintaining easy access to the capital''s amenities and services.","What makes Vilimale truly special is its role as a residential haven that successfully balances modern convenience with peaceful island living. Connected to Male by a bridge, the island provides the perfect escape from urban hustle while offering all the comforts of modern infrastructure, making it an ideal destination for families and travelers seeking a more relaxed pace of life.","Visitors to Vilimale are drawn by its peaceful atmosphere, family-friendly environment, excellent connectivity, modern residential infrastructure, beautiful beaches, and the opportunity to experience authentic contemporary Maldivian suburban life. The island offers a unique perspective on how modern Maldivians live and thrive in a tropical paradise setting."],"island_sections":[{"heading":"Location & Map","paragraphs":["Vilimale Island enjoys an exceptional location just 2 kilometers from Male City, connected by the Vilimale Bridge that provides seamless access between the residential tranquility of the island and the urban amenities of the capital. This strategic position makes Vilimale the perfect suburban retreat with unparalleled convenience and connectivity.","The island''s proximity to Male allows residents and visitors to enjoy the best of both worlds - peaceful residential living surrounded by beautiful beaches and lagoons, combined with easy access to government services, shopping, dining, and cultural attractions in the capital. The bridge connection eliminates the need for boat transfers, making travel convenient regardless of weather conditions."]},{"heading":"Vilimale: Residential Paradise & Suburban Tranquility","paragraphs":["Vilimale Island represents the evolution of modern Maldivian living, showcasing how contemporary families create comfortable, peaceful lives in a tropical paradise setting. The island offers visitors insights into suburban Maldivian culture and the harmonious balance between modern convenience and island tranquility."]},{"heading":"Modern Residential Community","paragraphs":["Experience well-planned residential neighborhoods with modern homes, tree-lined streets, community facilities, and family-friendly infrastructure that showcases contemporary Maldivian suburban living."]},{"heading":"Peaceful Beaches & Recreation","paragraphs":["Enjoy tranquil beaches, recreational areas, and waterfront spaces perfect for families, with clean sand, calm waters, and peaceful environments away from crowded tourist areas."]},{"heading":"Family-Friendly Environment","paragraphs":["Discover community parks, playgrounds, sports facilities, and family-oriented amenities that create a safe, welcoming environment perfect for families and peaceful vacations."]},{"heading":"Excellent Connectivity","paragraphs":["Benefit from seamless bridge connection to Male, providing easy access to urban amenities, cultural attractions, shopping, and services while maintaining peaceful island living."]},{"heading":"Residential Features","paragraphs":["Vilimale''s modern suburban amenities and infrastructure:"]},{"heading":"Suburban Experiences","paragraphs":["Authentic suburban island life activities and attractions:"]},{"heading":"Activities & Experiences","paragraphs":["Vilimale offers unique suburban island experiences that showcase peaceful family life and modern Maldivian residential culture. The island''s activities focus on relaxation, family enjoyment, and authentic suburban experiences while providing easy access to Male''s urban attractions."]},{"heading":"Family Beach & Recreation","paragraphs":["Enjoy peaceful family beach time, swimming, and recreational activities in safe, uncrowded environments perfect for children and relaxation."]},{"heading":"Suburban Community Exploration","paragraphs":["Explore residential neighborhoods, community parks, and local facilities to experience authentic modern Maldivian suburban life and culture."]},{"heading":"Scenic Bridge Walks","paragraphs":["Take leisurely walks across the Vilimale Bridge with beautiful views of Male, the lagoon, and surrounding islands while enjoying the convenience of connectivity."]},{"heading":"Local Life & Culture","paragraphs":["Experience authentic residential Maldivian culture through community interactions, local dining, and observation of daily suburban island life."]},{"heading":"Easy Male City Access","paragraphs":["Use Vilimale as a peaceful base for exploring Male''s attractions, markets, restaurants, and cultural sites with convenient bridge access."]},{"heading":"Peaceful Relaxation","paragraphs":["Enjoy tranquil environments, peaceful beaches, and relaxing suburban atmosphere perfect for unwinding and family bonding time."]},{"heading":"People & Residential Community","paragraphs":["Vilimale is home to approximately 12,000 residents who represent the modern face of Maldivian suburban living. This thriving residential community consists primarily of families who work in Male but prefer the peaceful, family-friendly environment that Vilimale provides, creating a unique suburban culture that balances modern convenience with traditional island values."]},{"heading":"Modern Suburban Community","paragraphs":["The island''s residents include government employees, business professionals, teachers, and families who have chosen Vilimale for its excellent quality of life, safe environment, and convenient access to Male. The community has developed a strong suburban identity that emphasizes family values, education, and peaceful coexistence in a tropical paradise setting."]},{"heading":"Family-Oriented Culture","paragraphs":["Vilimale''s culture revolves around family life and community well-being, with excellent schools, recreational facilities, and community programs that support child development and family bonding. The island serves as a model for how modern Maldivian families can maintain traditional values while embracing contemporary lifestyle and educational opportunities."]},{"heading":"Bridge Community","paragraphs":["The bridge connection to Male has created a unique \"bridge community\" where residents enjoy the best of both worlds - peaceful residential living with easy access to urban amenities. This connectivity has fostered a cosmopolitan outlook while maintaining the close-knit community bonds that characterize traditional Maldivian society."]}],"island_faqs":[{"question":"What makes Vilimale Island special for peaceful stays?","answer":"Vilimale Island offers a unique suburban paradise experience with peaceful residential neighborhoods, family-friendly environments, and excellent connectivity to Male via bridge. The island provides the perfect balance of tranquil island living and modern convenience, making it ideal for families and travelers seeking a peaceful retreat while maintaining easy access to urban amenities, cultural attractions, and services in the capital city."},{"question":"How is Vilimale connected to Male and what are the advantages?","answer":"Vilimale is connected to Male City by the Vilimale Bridge, providing seamless road access just 2 kilometers away. This connection offers numerous advantages including no boat transfers required, convenient access to Male''s restaurants and attractions, regular bus service, easy taxi transport, and the ability to walk between the islands. The bridge connection makes Vilimale perfect for those who want peaceful residential living with urban convenience."},{"question":"What type of accommodation and experiences are available on Vilimale?","answer":"Experiences include family beach activities, suburban community exploration, scenic bridge walks, local cultural interactions, and easy access to Male''s attractions. The island is perfect for families, peaceful retreats, and those wanting to experience authentic modern Maldivian suburban life."},{"question":"Is Vilimale suitable for families and what facilities are available?","answer":"Vilimale is exceptionally family-friendly with safe residential neighborhoods, community parks, playgrounds, sports facilities, and peaceful beaches perfect for children. The island offers modern amenities including schools, healthcare services, local shops, and family-oriented accommodations. The safe, suburban environment combined with easy access to Male''s services makes Vilimale an ideal choice for families seeking a peaceful, secure base for their Maldives vacation."}],"island_nearby_slugs":["himmafushi","huraa","dhiffushi","maafushi","gulhi","guraidhoo","hulhumale","male","kaashidhoo","gaafaru"]}'::jsonb
where node_type = 'location' and slug = 'villingili';


